I believe there are two mistakes here.  The chance of a corpse being left
is random and depends only on whether the monster is large, is a lizard, is
a golem, and what-not.  How (badly) you kill it is not a factor.

Also, Stormy can't draw life from undead critters.  So that is why Stormy
did not draw life from the Balrog.  Stormy won't draw life from zombies
either.

